# Deferred: default currency for item prices

**Status:** Deferred. New prices default to `Locale.current.currency` in `SetPriceView`; there is no user-configurable default in Settings.

## Goal when revisiting

1. Add a **Settings** control to choose the default currency used when setting/adding item prices.
2. Persist the preference (UserDefaults / profile / sync — decide when implementing).
3. Use it as the initial `selectedCurrency` in `SetPriceView` when the item has no price yet; existing prices keep their stored currency.
4. Keep `CurrencyFormatting.symbol` / display helpers consistent with the chosen default where appropriate.
5. Align with any later live price-formatting work (`set-price-live-formatting-deferred.mdc`).

## When done

Remove this rule.
